---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Hostinger VPS Review - VPSTier.com" description="Hostinger VPS starts at $3.99/mo with KVM virtualization, 24/7 support, and 30-day money-back guarantee. A reliable choice for developers and businesses.">

  <script type="application/ld+json">
{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "BreadcrumbList", "itemListElement": [{"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://vpstier.com/"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "VPS Reviews", "item": "https://vpstier.com/vps/"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "Hostinger Review", "item": "https://vpstier.com/vps/hostinger/"}]}
  </script>
  <script type="application/ld+json">
{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "Review", "name": "Hostinger Review", "reviewRating": {"@type": "Rating", "ratingValue": "4.1", "bestRating": "5"}, "author": {"@type": "Organization", "name": "VPSTier.com"}, "itemReviewed": {"@type": "Product", "name": "Hostinger VPS Hosting", "description": "Review of Hostinger VPS hosting service"}}
  </script>
  <script type="application/ld+json">
{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "What is the Hostinger affiliate commission rate?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "The Hostinger affiliate commission is $100-150/sale with a 90-day cookie window."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Is Hostinger good for developers?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Hostinger is rated 4.1/5 on VPSTier.com. It offers root access, competitive pricing, and strong uptime for developer workloads."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Does Hostinger offer GPU instances?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "GPU availability varies by provider. Check the full review for specifics on compute options."}}]}
  </script>



  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <a href="/vps" class="text-gray-500 hover:text-orange-500 text-sm mb-6 block">← Back to VPS Reviews</a>
    
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 items-start justify-between mb-8">
      <div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2">Hostinger VPS Review</h1>
        <div class="flex gap-4 text-sm text-gray-400">
          <span>Commission: <strong class="text-orange-500">$100-150/sale</strong></span>
          <span>Cookie: <strong>90 days</strong></span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="https://www.hostinger.com?REFERRALCODE=2BDTANSONG7B" target="_blank" rel="noopener" 
         class="bg-green-600 hover:bg-green-500 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-medium transition">
        Visit Hostinger →
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 mb-8">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
        <span class="text-2xl font-bold">4.2/5</span>
        <span class="text-gray-500">Developer Rating</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-gray-300">Hostinger VPS delivers enterprise-grade performance at affordable prices. With KVM virtualization, isolated resources, and a custom control panel, it's a top choice for developers who need reliability without the enterprise price tag.</p>
      <p class="text-gray-400 mt-2">Starting at $3.99/mo</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Key Features</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4">
          <div class="text-orange-400 font-bold mb-2">KVM Virtualization</div>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Full KVM-based isolation gives you dedicated resources and root access with zero overhead.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4">
          <div class="text-orange-400 font-bold mb-2">7 Global Datacenters</div>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">US (3), UK, Netherlands, Lithuania, Singapore, Brazil, and India for low-latency global access.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4">
          <div class="text-orange-400 font-bold mb-2">hPanel Control</div>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Hostinger's custom lightweight panel makes server management intuitive, even for beginners.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4">
          <div class="text-orange-400 font-bold mb-2">Weekly Backups</div>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Automatic weekly backups included. On-demand backup add-ons also available.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4">
          <div class="text-orange-400 font-bold mb-2">DDoS Protection</div>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Layered DDoS mitigation to keep your services online under attack.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4">
          <div class="text-orange-400 font-bold mb-2">30-Day Guarantee</div>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Full money-back guarantee within 30 days, no questions asked.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-8">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-green-400">Pros</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Excellent price-to-performance ratio</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Isolated KVM resources (no overselling)</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ User-friendly hPanel + full SSH/CLI access</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ 7 datacenter locations worldwide</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ 30-day money-back guarantee</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Free SSL via AutoSSL / Let's Encrypt</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ DDoS protection included</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-red-400">Cons</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ No GPU instances available</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ No Windows OS options (Linux only)</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ Managed WordPress hosting better than raw VPS support</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ Renewal prices higher than intro rates</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Plans & Pricing</h2>
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center py-3 border-b border-gray-800">
          <div>
            <span class="text-white font-medium">vCPU 1 / RAM 1GB / SSD 20GB</span>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs">Entry-level for light projects</p>
          </div>
          <span class="text-orange-400 font-bold">$3.99/mo</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center py-3 border-b border-gray-800">
          <div>
            <span class="text-white font-medium">vCPU 2 / RAM 2GB / SSD 50GB</span>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs">Popular choice for developers</p>
          </div>
          <span class="text-orange-400 font-bold">$6.99/mo</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center py-3 border-b border-gray-800">
          <div>
            <span class="text-white font-medium">vCPU 4 / RAM 4GB / SSD 100GB</span>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs">Scale for growing workloads</p>
          </div>
          <span class="text-orange-400 font-bold">$11.99/mo</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center py-3">
          <div>
            <span class="text-white font-medium">vCPU 6 / RAM 8GB / SSD 200GB</span>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs">High-performance tier</p>
          </div>
          <span class="text-orange-400 font-bold">$19.99/mo</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="border-t border-gray-800 pt-8">
      <a href="https://www.hostinger.com?REFERRALCODE=2BDTANSONG7B" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
         class="block text-center bg-green-600 hover:bg-green-500 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-bold transition">
        Sign Up via Our Affiliate Link
      </a>
      <p class="text-center text-gray-500 text-xs mt-3">
        We earn a commission when you sign up through our link. This doesn't affect our review.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
        <!-- In-Depth Review -->
        <div class="bg-[#111] border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Our Verdict</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">Hostinger has transformed from a budget shared host to a legitimate VPS player. The custom hPanel is divisive — some love its simplicity, others find it limiting compared to cPanel. What can't be argued: the price-to-performance ratio is exceptional for entry-level VPS needs.</p>
        </div>

</BaseLayout>
